      }
    ],
    "title": "## 2. What confirmed this isn't incidental",
    "text": "Full technical catalogue in `Aperas-kg-foundational-design.md`; summary of what was live-verified\nthis session, all against the real `aperas` TerminusDB instance:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
