    "title": "00CBFDYXMG00X",
    "text": "**ApeironNgn development — implemented, live-verified against the real mirror.**\n   `web/src/lib/apeironNgn/` (`vocab.ts`/`store.ts`/`node.ts`), checked via\n   `apeironNgnSmokeTest.ts` against every artifact in `AperasKG/Apeiron/` (23 artifacts, 1594\n   BlockNodes, node-for-node against the raw JSON-LD as ground truth — no TerminusDB dependency at\n   all, by design).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG00W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG00Y",
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG00Z",
