    ],
    "title": "00CBFDYXMG01R",
    "text": "`BaseNode` keeps exactly its current five fields — `title`/`text`/`key` move up to the new\n`TreeNode` level, not into `BaseNode` itself, since `Link`/`StringProp` (below) don't participate\nin the tree and shouldn't gain them.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG01M",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG01S",
