    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMG02C",
    "text": "`resolve.ts`'s `descend`/`resolveCreate.ts`'s equivalent (single-hop \"given this node, find the\n    child matching this segment\") → `node.findChild(text)`, used internally by the still-free\n    outer resolver rather than being its own CLI-facing fold. Read-only, throws on ambiguity, same\n    as the free functions it replaced.",
