    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG02D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMG02D",
    "text": "**New, needed to make the methods above (and `resolve.ts`'s per-hop descent) polymorphic\n    instead of branching on kind:** `get treeChildren(): TreeNode[]` (throws if a concrete class\n    doesn't override it — never actually reached, since `classForId` only ever dispatches to a\n    leaf class) plus `appendChild(childId: string): void`, both overridden per concrete class below\n    — together they replace `tree.ts`'s old `childNodes(node, kind)` and `resolve.ts`'s/\n    `resolveCreate.ts`'s equivalent kind-switches with ordinary virtual calls.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG028",
