    "title": "00CBFDYXMR011",
    "text": "**The synthetic root block was addressing-transparent but still physically real** — a second\ndocument per artifact purely because `kg:track` and `kg:ingest` used to be separate free functions,\neach needing \"the artifact\" and \"its content\" as separate things to mint/wire up. Once folded onto\none class each ([§4](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence]]>) [Step 3](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 3: fold migrated functions into class methods — implemented, verified]]>)), that separation was no longer a technical necessity, just left over from\nit — [Step 6](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 6: ingest ordering, `--track`, link-resolution reporting, and root-document addressing — implemented, verified]]>) patched every place the two-node split leaked into addressing (`findChild`/`appendChild`\ndelegation, `toPath`'s `type === 'root'` skip, `descend`'s double `.parent` hop on `..`, an\n\"already has a root\" guard against a second one) rather than removing the split itself.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR010",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR012",
    "text": "**`FolderNode.text`'s consuming rule required a literal top-level leading paragraph, which a\nrealistically-formatted README rarely has.** `folders.ts`'s `buildFolderTree` only consumed an\nabstract when the README's parsed root's *first child* was a bare `paragraph` — a README that opens\nwith a heading (the normal case: `# Title` first) produced an empty `FolderNode.text` every time,\nsilently. `ArtifactNode.text` never had this problem (`extractAbstract` already searched\npre-order, not just the first child), so the two node kinds had quietly diverged in robustness\nwithout that being a deliberate choice.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR010",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
