    ],
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR013",
    "text": "**Resolved by merging `ArtifactNode` into its own document content, and reusing `extractAbstract`\nfor both node kinds:**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR010",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR014",
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR015",
