    ],
    "title": "### Step 9: consistent tombstoning (incl. recursive artifact removal) and wikilink `Link` identity stability — implemented, verified",
    "text": "Resolves [§5](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/5. Open questions]]>)'s two tombstoning open questions (as they stood after [Step 8](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 8: `Link.props`, occurrence positions, and target-deduped wikilink edges — implemented, verified]]>)'s sweep), both left\nopen at the time.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMG00V",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR023",
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR027",
      "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR02C",
