    "title": "00CBFDYXMR023",
    "text": "**Tombstone consistency.** All three tombstone sites now clear `children`/`links`/`props` alike,\nmatching `applyTombstone`'s own original rationale (\"a dead node has no more use for `X`\"):",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR022",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": [
