    "title": "00CBFDYXMR024",
    "text": "`node.ts`'s `applyTombstone` (reconcile-driven, per removed block) now also clears `props` (it\n  already cleared `children`/`links`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR023",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR025",
