    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR028",
    "text": "`hydrateFromParsed` now carries `links` forward unconditionally (manual *and* wikilink alike) —\n  the id-churn fix no longer depends on stripping anything early.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR027",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR029",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR029",
    "text": "`ingestFromDisk` snapshots each matched block's *old* wikilink `Link`s (id, target, positions) via\n  a new `collectOldWikilinksByBlock`, at the same point (and for the same reason) it already\n  snapshots `oldLinkTargets` — before anything below it touches the tree.",
