    "title": "### Step 11: `parent`/`PARENT_PRED` merge, mark-and-sweep tombstone GC, and `kg:unlink` — implemented, verified",
    "text": "Three related changes from one thread of questions about `PARENT_PRED`/`siblingIndex` internals and\nthe \"hard half\" GC design from [Step 10](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 10: visible tombstones and dangling-`unfolds` cleanup — implemented, verified]]>).",
