    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR02V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR02V",
    "text": "**Verified**: `npm run build` clean; `npm run verify`'s full suite passing, plus two new cases: §10\nconstructs two tombstoned `BlockNode`s referencing only each other (no live root reaches either) plus\na third tombstoned node kept alive by a manual link from a still-live block, and confirms the mutual\npair is pruned while the referenced one survives; §11 removes that surviving manual link via\n`runRemoveBlockLink` and confirms a further GC pass then collects it, proving `kg:unlink` and the GC\ncompose correctly end-to-end.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR02P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
