    "text": "`kg:tree`/`kg:unfold` (and `kg:fold`) display: **no change** — keep printing the short compound id,\n  matching [§12 of Aperas-treeview-design.md](<[[/Aperas-treeview-design.md/# TreeView & Profile — Design/12. Depth legibility in plain-text tree output]]>)'s scannability work.",
