    "title": "00CBFDYXMR03K",
    "text": "Deferred, not forgotten: what happens when the KG grows to GB scale, given in-memory-only\n  storage means the whole thing is rehydrated from `AperasKG/Apeiron/`'s JSON-LD on every process\n  start and held entirely in RAM while running. Explicitly not solved now — revisit (`pyoxigraph`",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03J",
    "type": "listItem",
