    "text": "a projection bridge, a native non-WASM Node binding, or something else) once size actually\n  makes it a problem, not speculatively ahead of it.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
