    "title": "00CBFDYXMR03N",
    "text": "What pairs with Oxigraph for the regex/full-text secondary index ([§3](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/3. The concrete design]]>)) — a hand-rolled index over\n  the reified triples, or an existing embeddable engine (e.g. Tantivy)? **`kg:search`'s migration\n  is deliberately blocked on this** — not migrated ad hoc via a plain store scan in the meantime,\n  since that would just be thrown away once a real secondary index lands.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03P",
