    ],
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR03P",
    "text": "`client.ts`/`crud.ts`/`woql.ts`/`graphql.ts` already isolate every TerminusDB-specific call\n  behind named modules (`Aperas-architecture.md` §3) — does that boundary hold as-is for\n  ApeironNgn, or does the lazy-traversal query model ([§3](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/3. The concrete design]]>)) need a different shaped seam than\n  \"swap the implementation behind the same functions\"?",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03J",
