    "title": "00CBFDYXMR03Q",
    "text": "**Tombstoning consistency across the three places it happens — resolved by [Step 9](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 9: consistent tombstoning (incl. recursive artifact removal) and wikilink `Link` identity stability — implemented, verified]]>).** All three\n  now clear `children`/`links`/`props` alike (`artifacts.ts`'s artifact-tombstone also gained\n  recursive whole-subtree tombstoning, a second gap found while fixing the first) — see [Step 9](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 9: consistent tombstoning (incl. recursive artifact removal) and wikilink `Link` identity stability — implemented, verified]]>)'s\n  own write-up in [§4](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence]]>) for the full story.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03R",
