        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03S:links:Link:00CBFDYZDG003:props:StringProp:00CBFDYZDG004",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "599"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CBFDYXMR03S",
    "text": "**The tractable half: wikilink `Link`s used to churn identity even when nothing changed —\n    resolved by [Step 9](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 9: consistent tombstoning (incl. recursive artifact removal) and wikilink `Link` identity stability — implemented, verified]]>).** See [Step 9](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence/Step 9: consistent tombstoning (incl. recursive artifact removal) and wikilink `Link` identity stability — implemented, verified]]>)'s own write-up in [§4](<[[/Aperas-apeironngn-design.md/# ApeironNgn: Embedded Substrate Design/4. Rollout sequence]]>) for the full mechanism (moving the\n    reuse-or-remint decision from `hydrateFromParsed` into `resolveBlockLinks`, keyed on `target`\n    alone against a snapshot of each block's prior wikilink `Link`s — `position` drift alone\n    updates a matched `Link`'s `props` in place rather than reminting).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDYXMR03R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
