    "title": "00CBFDZ028006",
    "text": "**`kg:insert <path> [--after|--before <anchor>]`** ([§7](<[[/Aperas-crud-design.md/# Apeiron Node CRUD — Design/7. `kg:insert` — position, promote, or create]]>)) — concrete-only. No stdin: move\n  and/or promote an *existing* node. With piped markdown on stdin: create a brand-new concrete node\n  under an existing parent, positioned in one step.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ028005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ028007",
