    ],
    "title": "00CBFDZ02800A",
    "text": "**`kg:title <path> <title>`** ([§11](<[[/Aperas-crud-design.md/# Apeiron Node CRUD — Design/11. `kg:title`]]>)) — already implemented; included for completeness.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ028005",
