    "title": "00CBFDZ1W0026",
    "text": "**[§5](<[[/Aperas-treeview-design.md/# TreeView & Profile — Design/5. Rendering: three display tiers; `kg:unfold` touches exactly one ref]]>)'s breadcrumb-pruning question** — settled by [§4](<[[/Aperas-treeview-design.md/# TreeView & Profile — Design/4. Worked example]]>)'s `3`/`3.3`/`3.3.1` case: an interior\n  breadcrumb node prunes to just the relevant path, `Root` is the one exception.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W0025",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W0027",
