    "title": "00CBFDZ1W0028",
    "text": "**[§8](<[[/Aperas-treeview-design.md/# TreeView & Profile — Design/8. Git separation: a]]>)'s flush cadence** — two independently-tunable intervals, implemented.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W0025",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W0029",
