    "title": "## 13. Viewcone Zoom: projecting from an arbitrary apex",
    "text": "**Status: implemented (`node.ts`'s `discoverCone`/`emitNode`/`emitLinkLine`/`renderTreeWithView`),\nlive-verified against a synthetic graph reproducing [§13.1](<[[/Aperas-treeview-design.md/# TreeView & Profile — Design/13. Viewcone Zoom: projecting from an arbitrary apex/13.1 Worked example]]>)'s worked example exactly, byte-for-byte\ndown to the `2.2.l1→1.2` pointer and the `2`/`3.3.1` non-appearances — not yet exercised against\nthe real `AperasKG/Apeiron/` corpus, which has no live wikilinks yet to actually escape a cone with.\n`npm run verify`'s full suite (22/22, including its own Link/tombstone tree-rendering case) passes\nunchanged.**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W0001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W800F",
      "BlockNode:00CBFDZ1W800G",
